    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Before any item is moved, testing is performed. Electrical equipment is plugged into a power source and checked for correct voltage, continuity and grounding. Mechanical units (e.g., air‑conditioners, lifts) are powered on, run a short cycle and inspected for abnormal noises or vibrations.</p>
