    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Once cleared, each piece of furniture is placed according to the floor‑plan approved by the project manager. Surfaces are wiped with a lint‑free cloth and a mild cleaner to remove dust from transport. Alignment markers are used to ensure uniform spacing and orientation, facilitating later interior finishing work.</p>
